    "summaryHeadline": "Single solution core municipal bond allocation.",
    "summaryDescription": "A core municipal fund that pursues tax-exempt income consistent with capital preservation while seeking total return.",
    "benchmarkName": "85%/15% Bloomberg 1-15 Year Blend (1-17 Year) Municipal Bond Index/Bloomberg 1-15 Year Blend (1-17 Year) High Yield Municipal Bond Index",
